CommunityFinder is the second consumer application built on the honuware server
components (https://github.com/honuware/server_components) and the @honuware/ui
Angular component library (https://github.com/honuware/web_components). Those
components are separately licensed (Apache-2.0) in their own repositories.

This product bundles no third-party source, but links the following libraries at
build time, each under its own license (obtained via Conan): Boost, Crow, libpqxx,
OpenSSL, libsodium, mailio, GoogleTest, Abseil, HowardHinnant/date, libcurl,
libjpeg, libpng, libtiff, and zlib. The Angular client depends on @honuware/ui and
its npm dependency tree, each under its own license.
